A body that is not valid JSON gets 400 {"error": "BODY IS NOT VALID JSON"}
(Requirement 7.9).

### truncated JSON
POST /graves

{"title":
=> 400

{"error": "BODY IS NOT VALID JSON"}

### not JSON at all
POST /graves

bury me
=> 400

{"error": "BODY IS NOT VALID JSON"}

### trailing garbage
POST /graves

{"title": "x"} oops
=> 400

{"error": "BODY IS NOT VALID JSON"}

### valid JSON still works
POST /graves

{"title": "x"}
=> 201

{"dug": true}
